ologist (CRM-PR 21,876 RQE 16,038) and internal medicine physician based in Londrina, PR, Brazil, with over 20 years of practice in internal medicine, clinical nephrology, kidney transplant and hospital nephrology. Graduated in medicine from the State University of Londrina (UEL, 2004), with specialty training in internal medicine (2006) and nephrology (2008) at Santa Casa de Londrina, and specialist certification from the Brazilian Society of Nephrology. Has coordinated the nephrology medical residency at Santa Casa de Londrina since 2009 and founded the internal medicine residency in 2014. Member of the Cardiorenal Committee of the Brazilian Society of Nephrology. Postgraduate training in integrative functional medicine through the Brazilian Association of Integrative Functional Medicine (ABMFI, 2026). Clinical Director of Plenya - a program for preventive medicine, longevity, performance, nutrology and evidence-based supplementation. Author of the book 'Antes - The Silent Window Between Normal and Optimal' (2026, ISBN 978-65-02-06742-0). Areas of interest: preventive nephrology, the cardiorenal-metabolic axis, longevity and healthspan, advanced biomarkers and metabolic management."/><ENDERECO FLAG-DE-PREFERENCIA="ENDERECO_INSTITUCIONAL" ELETRONICO="I: getulio@plenyasaude.com.br; R: getamaral@yahoo.com" OUTRA-FORMA-DE-CONTATO="" REDE-SOCIAL="ID Rede Social: 7334118, Nome Rede Social: Instagram, Endereço: https://instagram.com/drGetulioAmaralFilhoID Rede Social: 7334119, Nome Rede Social: Linkedin, Endereço: https://www.linkedin.com/in/getulio-amaral-filho-951981404"><ENDERECO-PROFISSIONAL CODIGO-INSTITUICAO-EMPRESA="000100000991" NOME-INSTITUICAO-EMPRESA="Nefroclínica de Londrina" CODIGO-ORGAO="" NOME-ORGAO="" CODIGO-UNIDADE="" NOME-UNIDADE="" LOGRADOURO-COMPLEMENTO="Av Duque de Caxias, 1371" PAIS="Brasil" UF="PR" CEP="86015000" CIDADE="Londrina" BAIRRO="Jardim Petrópolis" DDD="43" TELEFONE="996380044" RAMAL="" FAX="" CAIXA-POSTAL="" E-MAIL="getulio@plenyasaude.co